# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Component Page Schema

The required shape of a component page. Every page under the components role is checked against
this document, and a page that does not conform is a failure rather than a style difference.

This exists because **a component page that is merely present cannot be told apart from one that is
complete.** Once there are dozens of them, nobody reads them all; a schema plus a check is what
keeps "100 documented components" from meaning "100 files".

Owned by whoever owns the components role. Changing it means changing every existing page in the
same change — see §5.

---

## 1. The required sections

Fixed names, fixed order. A page is conformant when every required section is present, in this
order, with content.

